# Files that are needed to develop and build the skin, but not to run it.
#
# When the skin is rolled out as a `git archive` of a release tag (as the Ansible role in
# ansible-site-ilias does, see README, "Installation"), everything marked export-ignore
# stays out of that archive and therefore out of the web root of the ILIAS server: sources
# and tooling have no business being served there. A plain `git clone` is not affected.
.github/                  export-ignore
screenshots/              export-ignore
tools/                    export-ignore
LUH-Style/scss/          export-ignore
update-skin.sh            export-ignore
tpl.xml                   export-ignore
release-please-config.json     export-ignore
.release-please-manifest.json  export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md              export-ignore
.gitattributes            export-ignore
.gitignore                export-ignore
# The registration core patch is applied from the skin folder on the server
# (components/ILIAS/Registration/README.md), so that folder stays in the archive.
